<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — CG Design & Co."
  description="How CG Design & Co. collects, uses, and protects your personal data."
  pageTitle="Privacy Policy"
  lastUpdated="7 September 2026"
>
  <p class="fill-in">
    <strong>Before publishing:</strong> fill in the registered business
    address and confirm the contact email below. These are marked inline.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website is operated by CG Design &amp; Co. (ABN 25 672 082 550)
    ("we", "us", "our"), a web design studio based in Australia. Our
    registered/business address is
    <strong>[ADDRESS — TO BE ADDED]</strong>. You can contact us about
    anything in this policy at
    <a href="mailto:hello@cgdesignco.com.au">hello@cgdesignco.com.au</a>
    <strong>[CONFIRM THIS IS YOUR REAL EMAIL]</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you use this site, we may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Enquiry form details</strong> — your name, email address,
      business name, existing website URL (if you give one), the service
      you're asking about, and, if you've used the pricing estimator, a
      summary of what you selected. We only ask for what we need to reply
      to you.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical data</strong> — standard information your browser
      sends automatically to any website, such as your IP address and
      browser type, as part of loading the page and fonts.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not use analytics, advertising, or tracking scripts on this site,
    and we don't buy, sell, or share your data with third parties for
    marketing purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>We use the information you give us to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Reply to your enquiry and discuss your project.</li>
    <li>Prepare a quote or proposal if you ask for one.</li>
    <li>Keep a record of the enquiry for our own reference.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We rely on your consent (given when you submit the form) and our
    legitimate interest in responding to enquiries as the legal basis for
    this.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiry form submissions are delivered to us via
    <a href="https://formspree.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Formspree</a>,
    a third-party form-handling service that processes the submission on
    our behalf. This site's fonts are served by Google Fonts, which may log
    your IP address as part of that request. We don't share your details
    with anyone else.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiry details for as long as reasonably needed to respond to
    you and, if you become a client, for the duration of our working
    relationship and a reasonable period afterwards for our records. If you
    ask us to delete your details and we have no ongoing reason to keep
    them, we will.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    As a small business, we're generally exempt from the Privacy Act 1988,
    but we handle your data in line with the Australian Privacy Principles
    (APPs) as good practice. You can ask us to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Tell you what personal data we hold about you.</li>
    <li>Correct anything that's inaccurate.</li>
    <li>Delete your data, where we don't have a legal reason to keep it.</li>
    <li>Stop using your data for a particular purpose.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To do any of this, email
    <a href="mailto:hello@cgdesignco.com.au">hello@cgdesignco.com.au</a>. If
    you're not happy with how we've handled your data, you can complain to
    the
    <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Office of the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC)</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows
    when it was last changed.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
